    text: "Audit evidence 2026-07-04 continuation: inspected all statuses with pm list --status all, pm stats, pm aggregate, pm validate --check-resolution --check-history-drift, pm health --check-only --summary, pm next, active duplicate-title scan, active parent-link scan, and live gh issue/pr list. Live totals: 1506 pm items, 1514 history streams, 24446 history entries. Status distribution: 37 open, 13 in_progress, 1444 closed, 12 canceled, 0 blocked. Type distribution: 1 Milestone, 81 Epics, 286 Features, 286 Issues, 524 Tasks, 224 Chores, 17 Plans, 50 Decisions, 36 Stories, 1 Reminder. Active structure: 50 active items, zero active non-epic orphans, zero duplicate-looking active titles, pm next ready=36 blocked=0. GitHub cross-check: one open issue GH-427, already tracked by in_progress pm-lt6n; zero open PRs. Existing broad audit lineages pm-y904 and pm-osea are closed with evidence and remain canonical, so no duplicate audit item was created. Residual governance: validate reports validate_resolution_missing_fields:268 on closed historical items, already represented by open pm-e9zh; active metadata filter only flags claimed epic pm-4ak1 for missing estimate/reviewer/sprint/release metadata, noted there without taking over the claim."
