    text: "Ecosystem audit #7 (2026-07-06, maintainer-agent). Verified live: npm 2026.7.6 published (auto-release healthy, logged on pm-7zs0); ADR pm-muhw accepted; first SDK execution primitive shipped (pm-xzhz, PR #456). Coverage gap closed: all 20 open GitHub issues lacking tracker items are now tracked — 18 new dedup-checked items (16 dogfood findings under pm-mpbb/pm-8jdc/pm-5k4v/pm-ydp6/pm-5oj5, contracts-summary pm-vxxm under pm-n7rr) + triage chore pm-7cx8 for stale reports GH-436/GH-440 (features verified already shipped). GH-427 remains tracked by in-progress pm-lt6n. pm-n7rr grammar mapping now covers all 64 live top-level spellings (aggregate/test-all homes recorded on ADR pm-pbyu + pm-6apl). Validate warnings unchanged and all map to open items: resolution/close_reason -> pm-e9zh, GH-209 dupe -> pm-pivf, linked-files -> pm-j8z6. Zero orphans among active items; agent-story layer intact (14)."
