    text: "Directed PM-hygiene pass 2026-07-12 (not a review pass): live-verified store health (1752 items, 0 history drift), release state (npm 2026.7.12 shipped; scheduled auto-release failed but manual dispatch succeeded), main CI green, nightly windows red tracked by pm-b24b. Metadata census on all 189 open items: 100% priority/risk/confidence/AC/estimates; GH coverage 20/20 open issues mapped; all 6 validate warning classes owned by open items (pm-2ler, pm-j8z6, pm-pivf, pm-e9zh). Fixed the one gap: 16 open items had no parent lineage (violating this milestone's zero-orphan AC). Parented: yh8r+kb5h->92if, b24b+hous+ulqu+x2vx+g543->mpbb, l9wl+dudr+ec8s->ugqx, wfvq->u9d0, ksv2->5oj5, 6irg+2ler+wenq->33cw, qfdd->usfg; tag backfill on yh8r/kb5h/6irg. Open orphans now 0."
