    text: "Portfolio audit evidence 2026-07-13: an exhaustive CLI-based sweep read 1,784 pre-mutation items across every status, 6,546 current comments, and all 28,195 mutation events from 1,792 history streams. Health, integrity, and history drift were green. The one known validation warning class, validate_resolution_missing_fields:276, remains mapped to pm-e9zh. Exact, fuzzy, and parent-scope duplicate audits found no active duplicate cluster; the active hierarchy had one root, no missing parent, and no active child beneath a terminal parent. This pass enhanced descriptions on 26 open items, restored tags on pm-srns, and added only pm-mp49 and pm-v657 after all-status duplicate checks. Roadmap sequencing: decide pm-pbyu before the command consolidation chain; continue SDK-first extraction under pm-usfg; execute pm-801d then pm-3hps while pm-atfm and pm-lixy advance context quality; close workspace audit gaps through pm-klo8 and pm-9yfo; retain multi-year scale, federation, ecosystem, and beyond-PM exemplar horizons. No commit or push was performed."
