    text: "All-status ecosystem organization pass 2026-07-13: inspected all 1,786 pre-pass items and 28,283 immutable history events across 1,794 streams, all statuses, the 67-command live contract, SDK and package boundaries, repository and test/docs surfaces, duplicate clusters, normalization, lifecycle, storage size, metadata coverage, and graph topology. Reused existing canonical lineages for CLI simplification pm-n7rr, SDK-first pm-usfg, scale/context pm-9rxu and pm-4k6b, immutable history pm-o2kc/pm-9yfo, terminal evidence pm-e9zh, and beyond-PM pm-8ngt. Added the non-duplicate graph maturity program pm-96h7 with ADR pm-4jqm, SDK graph primitives pm-ju83, analytics pm-7ob5, governance pm-6x7o, agent story pm-8xr8, conformance pm-m2il, reconstruction plan pm-a8zm and three deep waves pm-p9a4/pm-qnl2/pm-lnrk; added digital-twin exemplar pm-kr3t and live query issue pm-y4z5. Enriched evidence-backed active relationships only. Post-pass duplicate, lifecycle, history, health, and graph proofs are recorded on pm-96h7. No commit or push was performed."
