    text: "All-status ecosystem review 2026-07-18: inspected 1,866 live items across every stored status (1,628 closed, 226 open, 12 canceled), 30,491 immutable activity entries spanning 2026-02-17 through 2026-07-18, all full item bodies/metadata, hierarchy, dependencies, schema, command contracts, graph findings, duplicate audits, validation, and health. All 226 active items are parented under the single living milestone, have acceptance criteria, estimates, risk, and confidence; no active item has a terminal parent, missing parent, or missing history. Dependency semantics derive 35 blocked items; blocked is not a stored lifecycle status. Exact/fuzzy dedupe found only the three already-canceled accidental probe items; parent-scope dedupe found zero clusters. Graph audit found zero actionable defects: 1,869 nodes, 3,108 edges, zero active isolates, with only classified legacy or deliberate info findings. One evidence-backed non-duplicate gap was filed as pm-szdc; every other directive area maps to an existing canonical owner."
