  - created_at: "2026-07-22T18:26:34.746Z"
    author: codex-root
    text: "Ecosystem planning evidence 2026-07-22: live all-status inventory reviewed 1,912 items and 32,156 immutable activity events before organization, including 221 open, 1,679 closed, and 12 canceled items. The review covered full item bodies and metadata, activity, schema, help, contracts, storage and field coverage, exact/fuzzy/parent duplicate checks, validation, health, graph audit, descendants, execution analysis, communities, centrality, articulation, dominators, and remediation planning. Active graph coverage was already complete: 221 active nodes, zero active isolates, and zero degree-one active nodes. Exact/fuzzy duplicate output contained only the known canceled accidental probe cluster; parent-scope duplicate output was empty. Canonical delivery owners were reused. New pm-m08hza governs evidence-based portfolio horizons, and new pm-g8t7b9 governs one-to-one disposition of context algorithm ideas without bypassing pm-vvib. Sparse future stories and five live metadata gaps were enriched; no delivery feature was duplicated."
  - created_at: "2026-07-22T18:28:19.676Z"
    author: codex-root
    text: "Post-organization evidence 2026-07-22: tracker totals became 1,914 items, 1,922 streams, and 32,188 events before final evidence comments. Graph edges increased from 3,321 to 3,366 while active isolates and degree-one active nodes remained zero; the increase is semantic prerequisite and evidence linkage, not arbitrary connectivity. Validation has zero history drift, all active non-root metadata gaps are cleared, duplicate results are unchanged, and build/changelog/contracts/static/package-boundary/token-budget gates passed."
