    text: "Audit #8 (2026-07-06, maintainer-agent): full verification pass over all 1558 items, no gaps found, zero new items needed (dedupe-checked). Verified live: (1) GitHub coverage 1:1 — all 21 open GH issues map to exactly one open pm item (GH-436/440 shipped-stale, covered by triage chore pm-7cx8); no GH issue newer than GH-458. (2) Shipped work closed — pm-xzhz (PR#456), pm-8778 (PR#431), pm-q1ke (PR#434), pm-2muu/pm-8t5x (PR#430) all closed with resolution/expected/actual. PRs #447/#451 (auto-release ratchet fix + blocker-retry) are release-train maintenance logged on living reminder pm-7zs0 per its charter. (3) Structure — zero orphan open items; 14 agent stories (one per capability epic + pm-1kxs/pm-w89s for the initiative epics); this milestone index current; initiative epics pm-n7rr (14 children) and pm-usfg (14 children, 3 closed) fully cover the 64-command grammar and SDK promotion families. (4) Governance — every pm validate warning maps to exactly one open item; files 146 missing +131 orphaned -> pm-j8z6; duplicate issue-code GH-209 -> pm-pivf; close_reason 18 + resolution fields 269 -> pm-e9zh. (5) In-progress items all legitimately claimed (pm-4ak1 docstrings epic by maintainer-agent; pm-lt6n, pm-92if by claude-code-agent). New audit-#7 items spot-checked: parent/AC/estimate/risk/confidence complete."
