    text: "Ecosystem audit #9 (2026-07-06, session): full gates green on main+working tree (build, 5436 tests, eslint 0 warn, jscpd 0 clones, static-quality, contracts, secrets, changelog drift, docs links). Sandbox verification: packed tarball via npx OK (11 packages); external npm ecosystem smoke OK (pm-github/pm-changelog/pm-jira/pm-beads/@unbrained/pm-web/pm-graph/pm-csv/pm-ts-starter, 0 failed); CJS-host install+init+create+list OK; SDK 328 ESM exports + 43 testing exports importable, CJS require interops; scaffold->install->run extension end-to-end OK; never-block recovery verified (pm doctor suggests extension/package doctor). New items: pm-og1v (P1 lancedb cwd-relative path bug, FIXED in tree + 4 regression tests), pm-2czc (P1 dependabot unblock: @types/node 26 Stats type fix + cooldown + codeql group, FIXED in tree), pm-tgq6 (P3 Windows lock-test flake, GH-427 closed as stale/tracked), pm-p5u6 (P2 temp-footprint pruning after /tmp quota exhaustion broke local tooling mid-audit). GH hygiene: retitled #452/#453/#454 dogfood issues to real summaries with pm ids; confirmed every open GH issue maps to a pm item. Startup perf: pm --version 157ms, list 718ms, get 580ms @1558 items (extension latency tracked by pm-4oww). Nightly 2026-07-06 green on all platforms."
