    author: maintainer-agent
    text: "Ecosystem audit #11 (2026-07-06, post-PR#466): ZERO backlog gaps; one live CLI bug found while recording this note (filed, see below). Verified: (1) all 20 open GH issues map to pm items or triage chore pm-7cx8 (GH-455 fix shipped via pm-aems, GH closure queued there); (2) PR#466 merged 12:47Z — pm-6e1d closed, pm-rjqr intentionally in_progress (CLI query-handler flip shared with capstone pm-9x6e); (3) all 12 in_progress items claimed and recently updated (docstring epic pm-4ak1 lanes, pm-lt6n, pm-92if); (4) zero draft/blocked items; (5) every active item parented — milestone-rooted tree intact; (6) all 5 validate warning classes map to open items (files→pm-j8z6, dup issue-code→pm-pivf, close_reason+resolution→pm-e9zh); (7) npm 2026.7.6 published 07:10Z — auto-release healthy (pm-7zs0 satisfied for today); (8) initiative epics pm-n7rr + pm-usfg trees complete, no new promotion/consolidation gaps since audit #10. Live bug found: `pm notes <id> --add --stdin` silently stored the literal text \"--stdin\" as a note (flag-like token swallowed as value; notes also lack comments' --stdin/--edit/--delete parity, so the bad note needed a manual state revert + history re-anchor check). Filed as a new Issue under pm-mpbb this session."
