    text: "Full-backlog review pass 2026-07-07 (flow-health + rule-compliance angle). Live verified: release 2026.7.7 on npm; PR #478 and commit 4469b47e both already reconciled (pm-5h9g/pm-alnj, pm-6abs closed with evidence); 4 in_progress items are the active SDK-first lane (pm-usfg/pm-w89s/pm-x6jf/pm-cbwg), no phantom WIP. Flow health: 192 open (1 P0 roadmap milestone, 47 P1, 106 P2, 33 P3, 5 P4), stalest open item updated 3 days ago, 34/192 blocked_by-gated, history drift 0/1683. GH coverage: all open GitHub issues map to pm items; GH-467 closed upstream with evidence comment (shipped pm-6abs) and the drift recorded as fresh evidence on pm-rml5. Grooming: pm-96wm ADR closed (all 9 deferred findings verified shipped); session-naming rule enforced across 18 open items (title/description/body/AC reworded to review-pass phrasing, audit tag retired; immutable comments left as historical proof). No new gaps found — gap surface remains exhausted; no new items filed (dedupe checks: close-sync gap already owned by pm-rml5). Validate warnings unchanged and all map to open items (pm-e9zh, pm-pivf, pm-j8z6)."
  - created_at: "2026-07-07T14:29:34.444Z"
    author: maintainer-agent
    text: "Full-backlog review pass 2026-07-07 (27th, planning-and-enrichment angle). Live verified: release 2026.7.7 on npm + GH release v2026.7.7; 193 open / 4 in_progress (SDK-first family pm-usfg/pm-w89s/pm-x6jf/pm-cbwg, all actively assigned to codex-agent with same-day activity — real WIP, not phantom) / 0 blocked; 1683 items total. All 22 open GH issues map to existing pm items (full GH<->pm reconciliation holds). All validate warnings map to open items: 18 closed-missing-close_reason -> pm-e9zh (blocked on pm-m4iu/pm-wrbe chain), GH-209 duplicate issue-code -> pm-pivf, linked-file drift -> pm-j8z6. Theme-coverage sweep against the product philosophy found no untracked gaps: CLI simplification (pm-n7rr + 12 consolidation tasks + ADR pm-pbyu), token efficiency (pm-cfed/nilh/g9xk/vxxm/ishm + gate pm-cu1i + baseline pm-a22j), context algorithms (pm-4k6b family incl. per-agent author-affinity signal already in pm-3hps AC), cognitive architecture (pm-vvib, subsystem candidate #11 interference-and-belief-revision added as ADR note this pass), SDK-first (pm-usfg, 2/9 domains done, remaining domains all itemized), immutable history (pm-9yfo/klo8/3z0k/u14c/hib1/wrbe/m4iu), composability (pm-646c/psy1/m9xv/plwm/iktj/kipd), scale (pm-9rxu family), beyond-PM SDK (pm-8ngt/xtrd/xc68), federation (pm-is1a). Zero new items filed — dedupe checks rejected one candidate (per-agent context personalization: already covered as the author-affinity signal in pm-4k6b/pm-3hps). Highest-leverage next executable: pm-m4iu (P1 closed_at stamp defect, root cause of changelog drag-trap)."
  - created_at: "2026-07-07T14:46:35.019Z"
