    text: "Review pass 2026-07-07 (#28, verification + planning): store 1683 items (191 open / 4 in_progress / 1476 closed / 12 canceled), health clean, release 2026.7.7 published and matching local. All 4 in_progress items are today's active SDK-first work (pm-usfg family, codex-agent) — no phantom WIP. PRs 477–479 fully reconciled (pm-6abs closed for the doctor-diagnostics ship). All 15 open GH issues (445–473) map to open pm items. All 5 validate warning classes remain owned (pm-j8z6 files 147/125, pm-pivf dup code, pm-e9zh close_reason 18 + resolution 269) with fresh drift counts commented on the owners. New this pass: pm-vvib cognitive-subsystem candidate #12 novelty-detection/orienting-response (system-derived per-author watermark from history authorship → change-salience in context assembly; beyond closed pm-ankr manual windows), and a verified flag-suggester defect (incomplete '--format valid on' hint list) recorded on pm-gdi7. Zero new items — reconciliation-first per exhausted gap surface; next executable remains pm-m4iu (P1 closed_at stamp)."
