    text: "Planning review pass 2026-07-07 (#31): verification-led, no new items needed. (a) Reconciliation: PR#479 (isolated project doctor diagnostics) maps to pm-6abs, already closed; all 21 open GH issues have exactly one pm item each; release health verified live (npm 2026.7.7 = local, auto-release runs correctly skipping post-cut). (b) Hygiene: filled the only 2 missing estimated_minutes (pm-hfg5/pm-yl6c, my own prior filings); drift steady (resolution 269, close_reason 18, history_drift 0/0/0/0); in_progress lane unchanged (4 codex-agent SDK items); zero blocked items. (c) Enrichment: pm-vvib gained candidate subsystem (8) habit formation / procedural acquisition (episode-mining recurring action sequences into suggested templates/plans; distinct from consolidation and pm-uwfs); pm-4k6b gained algorithm (7) two-stage retrieval funnel with per-source candidate quotas (the recall stage that keeps scoring O(quotas) not O(items) at pm-g2zz scale). (d) Known-defect evidence: pm next again recommended foreign in_progress WIP (pm-w89s, codex-agent) to a different caller — same behavior pm-yl6c already owns, no change, not re-filed. Tooling note: TOON list footer's filters block makes naive grep -c 'status:' overcount by one — count from the JSON .items array or the TOON count: scalar instead."
