    text: "Planning pass 2026-07-07 (evening): reconciliation + enrichment, no gaps found. Reconciled PR #478 (hybrid --limit post-fusion + context --max-items alias; pm-alnj/pm-5h9g self-closed with test-run evidence, GH-474/476 closed) and PR #479 (isolated package/extension doctor; pm-6abs self-closed, GH-467 closed, docstring-gate residue owned by open pm-4ak1). Release v2026.7.7 cut and live on npm; auto-release post-cut skips healthy. Validate drift steady at 147/125/269/18 + GH-209 dup (all owned by open items; no change). Open GH issues 469-473 all tracked (pm-sqf7/pm-bfma/pm-h85e/pm-4bzq/pm-yjim). Enrichment: pm-vvib candidate (10) chunking/expert compression (structure-based retrieval-time chunks; distinct from pm-5qmm age-based epoch consolidation; builds on shipped pm-gcm3 rollup primitive) and pm-4k6b algorithm (9) granularity-adaptive packing (multiple-choice knapsack over representation levels; no-cliff gist degradation; prices chunk substitution as a level). Live probes of both PR #478 surfaces passed in the real workspace. No new defects observed; no items created (nothing untracked found)."
